== Use of AI in the Written Part of this Thesis

Artificial Intelligence (AI) was used during the work on this thesis. This
thesis was spell checked, edited, and grammar enhanced by Anthropic's Claude
Opus 5 Large Language Model throughout. Every suggestion was reviewed and
possibly corrected by the author. 

== Use of AI in the Practical Part of this Thesis

AI was used in the practical part of this thesis as well. For instance, Claude
Opus 5 by Anthropic was used to locate relevant register descriptions and
timing requirements inside the microcontroller reference manual and the sensor
datasheets, and to refactor and optimise firmware code. All generated code was
reviewed by the author and verified on the vehicle.
